{"id":"b2d9e5da3806795d","group":"72","path":"72/72-lem-formula-alpha-invariance.md","title":"α等价保持自由变量、秩和语义","display":"lem-formula-alpha-invariance — α等价保持自由变量、秩和语义","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-lem-formula-alpha-invariance","aliases":["72-lem-formula-alpha-invariance"],"display":"lem-formula-alpha-invariance — α等价保持自由变量、秩和语义","depends_on":["[[72-df-formula-alpha-equivalence]]","[[72-df-propositional-evaluation]]","[[72-df-four-valued-structure]]"],"chapter":"I","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I §2.3.1–2.3.4, print31–33/PDF43–45; local binding-code induction","source_kind":"source-driven-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-context-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local argument recorded; source correspondence and finite regression distinguished","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_23":"将相同绑定结构不变性扩展到逻辑程序四值解释"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-lem-formula-alpha-invariance"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-lem-formula-alpha-invariance</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-formula-alpha-invariance — α等价保持自由变量、秩和语义"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1844f67828428aae\" href=\"?note=1844f67828428aae\" title=\"72-df-formula-alpha-equivalence\">72-df-formula-alpha-equivalence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5c014dab66d624c8\" href=\"?note=5c014dab66d624c8\" title=\"72-df-propositional-evaluation\">72-df-propositional-evaluation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"40bb12b12b7a39e7\" href=\"?note=40bb12b12b7a39e7\" title=\"72-df-four-valued-structure\">72-df-four-valued-structure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"I"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I §2.3.1–2.3.4, print31–33/PDF43–45; local binding-code induction"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-driven-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-context-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local argument recorded; source correspondence and finite regression distinguished"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_23","html":"将相同绑定结构不变性扩展到逻辑程序四值解释"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in X_\\Sigma\">\\(A,B\\in X_\\Sigma\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in V\">\\(x\\in V\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M=\\langle D,I_C,I_F,I_R\\rangle\">\\(\\mathfrak M=\\langle D,I_C,I_F,I_R\\rangle\\)</span> 为合法非空结构，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in D^V\">\\(s\\in D^V\\)</span>。代入仍是原有部分自由代入，不在未满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}\">\\(\\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}\\)</span> 时取值。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>四值附式中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 是签名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 的 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"40bb12b12b7a39e7\" href=\"?note=40bb12b12b7a39e7\" title=\"72-df-four-valued-structure\">72-df-four-valued-structure</a> 结构、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in D^V\">\\(s\\in D^V\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{LPFml}_\\Sigma\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{LPFml}_\\Sigma\\)</span>，四值求值使用同一域及全部项解释。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_{\\alpha,\\Sigma}B\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(B)\\land\n\\operatorname{rk}(A)=\\operatorname{rk}(B)\\land\n\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak M,s}(A)=\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak M,s}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\equiv_{\\alpha,\\Sigma}B\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(B)\\land\n\\operatorname{rk}(A)=\\operatorname{rk}(B)\\land\n\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak M,s}(A)=\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak M,s}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_{\\alpha,\\Sigma}B\\land\\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}(t,x,A)\\land\\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}(t,x,B)\n\\Longrightarrow A[t/x]\\equiv_{\\alpha,\\Sigma}B[t/x].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\equiv_{\\alpha,\\Sigma}B\\land\\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}(t,x,A)\\land\\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}(t,x,B)\n\\Longrightarrow A[t/x]\\equiv_{\\alpha,\\Sigma}B[t/x].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{LPFml}_\\Sigma\\land A\\equiv_{\\alpha,\\Sigma}B\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ ⟦ A⟧_{M,s}=⟦ B⟧_{M,s}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A,B\\in\\mathsf{LPFml}_\\Sigma\\land A\\equiv_{\\alpha,\\Sigma}B\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ ⟦ A⟧_{M,s}=⟦ B⟧_{M,s}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对共同的绑定结构编码作归纳。自由标签恰好记录自由变量，构造深度恰好记录秩。语义归纳加强为允许两条不同变量名的栈，但其对应栈位置给同一域元素；最近位置处理同名遮蔽，自由标签使用同一外部赋值。进入量词时给两个新栈头同一任意域元素，因此量词真值相同；其余构造直接使用项值或真值函数。这给第一式。</p>\n<p>第二式对同一编码归纳：自由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 标签替成相同项编码，其他自由标签和绑定标签不变。两端的自由代入条件保证没有自由项变量变成绑定标签。此结论不允许省略任一端的合法性条件，也不把语义等价误认成 α 等价。</p>\n<p>2026-10-23：四值附式沿相同绑定编码归纳，字面量读取同一项值，合取/析取读取同一坐标min/max，量词对同一域元素作对应环境更新。因此不仅正坐标相同，完整四值都相同；不借经典二值有效性推出四值等价。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-formula-alpha-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"1844f67828428aae","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-formula-alpha-equivalence]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-propositional-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"5c014dab66d624c8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-propositional-evaluation]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-four-valued-structure","status":"resolved","id":"40bb12b12b7a39e7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-four-valued-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-four-valued-structure","status":"resolved","id":"40bb12b12b7a39e7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"四值附式中 $M$ 是签名 $\\Sigma$ 的 [[72-df-four-valued-structure]] 结构、$s\\in D^V$；$A,B\\in\\mathsf{LPFml}_\\Sigma$，四值求值使用同一域及全部项解释。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\in X_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M=\\langle D,I_C,I_F,I_R\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in D^V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in D^V","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{LPFml}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"A\\equiv_{\\alpha,\\Sigma}B\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(B)\\land\n\\operatorname{rk}(A)=\\operatorname{rk}(B)\\land\n\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak M,s}(A)=\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak M,s}(B).","display":true},{"tex":"A\\equiv_{\\alpha,\\Sigma}B\\land\\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}(t,x,A)\\land\\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}(t,x,B)\n\\Longrightarrow A[t/x]\\equiv_{\\alpha,\\Sigma}B[t/x].","display":true},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{LPFml}_\\Sigma\\land A\\equiv_{\\alpha,\\Sigma}B\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ ⟦ A⟧_{M,s}=⟦ B⟧_{M,s}.","display":true},{"tex":"x","display":false}],"bytes":2935,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-23","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"I章新增5项：[[72-df-formula-alpha-equivalence]] · [[72-df-sequent-alpha-conversion]] · [[72-df-strong-inference-size]] · [[72-ex-alpha-conversion-cut-elimination]] · [[72-lem-formula-alpha-invariance]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-19","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"I章新增5项：[[72-df-formula-alpha-equivalence]] · [[72-df-sequent-alpha-conversion]] · [[72-df-strong-inference-size]] · [[72-ex-alpha-conversion-cut-elimination]] · [[72-lem-formula-alpha-invariance]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-19","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"I章新增5项：[[72-df-formula-alpha-equivalence]] · [[72-df-sequent-alpha-conversion]] · [[72-df-strong-inference-size]] · [[72-ex-alpha-conversion-cut-elimination]] · [[72-lem-formula-alpha-invariance]]"},{"id":"92e9c5c40b78fb74","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"edf9ec90faf33353","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["1844f67828428aae","5c014dab66d624c8","40bb12b12b7a39e7"]}